@Uptrail_Backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5059

### ==========================================
### PlatformAdmin Management Endpoints
### ==========================================

### 1. Create Platform Admin
POST {{Uptrail_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/PlatformAdmin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Super Admin",
  "email": "admin@uptrail.com",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "phoneNumber": "+1234567890",
  "profileImageUrl": "https://example.com/avatar.jpg"
}

### 2. Get All Platform Admins
GET {{Uptrail_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/PlatformAdmin
Accept: application/json

### 2a. Search Platform Admins (by partial name, email, or phone)
GET {{Uptrail_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/PlatformAdmin?searchTerm=admin
Accept: application/json

### 2b. Search Platform Admins using /search route
GET {{Uptrail_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/PlatformAdmin/search?searchTerm=1234
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get Platform Admin By Id (Replace with actual GUID)
@adminId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{Uptrail_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/PlatformAdmin/{{adminId}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Update Platform Admin By Id (Replace with actual GUID)
PUT {{Uptrail_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/PlatformAdmin/{{adminId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Super Admin Updated",
  "email": "admin@uptrail.com",
  "phoneNumber": "+1987654321",
  "profileImageUrl": "https://example.com/avatar-updated.jpg",
  "isEmailVerified": true,
  "isActive": true
}

### 5. Delete Platform Admin By Id (Replace with actual GUID)
DELETE {{Uptrail_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/PlatformAdmin/{{adminId}}
Accept: application/json


### ==========================================
### PlatformAdmin Auth Endpoints
### ==========================================

### 6. Platform Admin Login
# @name login
POST {{Uptrail_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/PlatformAdminAuth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@uptrail.com",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

### 7. Refresh Token
@refreshToken = your_refresh_token_here
POST {{Uptrail_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/PlatformAdminAuth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 8. Logout
POST {{Uptrail_Backend_HostAddress}}/api/PlatformAdminAuth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}
